ugfix-size gate degrades to advisory on classification error). depends_on edges: velvetworm->esok; spoonbill->esok,velvetworm; finch->blackfish; pterosaurs->equine. Probe ticket dihydric-barnacled-goat created by mistake and force-closed as obsolete.","timestamp":1787359166675735001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Operator decisions recorded: path-based bug escalation rejected (overfit); diff-coverage floor rejected (behavioural/contract testing policy); external import-check and post-rebase re-verify rejected (scheduled main CI covers); concurrency blocking deferred pending the routing replay; fail-open gate posture preserved as documented. Observations not yet ticketed: local security detectors time out and fail closed in review-code; reviewer drops findings on snapshot files reported 'not readable via repo tools'; enrich drain gate check ~1s per write on this store (> 20 ms budget).","timestamp":1787359177382058001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Headline: 221 bug tickets (7–21 Aug 2026) analysed, 196 real, 56 git-dated to in-window changes (ticket prose labels wrong 43/196). Today's reviewer re-run on 3 introducing changes blocks 1/3 and finds the defect in 2/3; the lever is routing, not thresholds. Bug-fix escalation backtest (641 fixes): no diff-computed complexity signal beats the 150-line floor; repeat-fix (same file bug-fixed >=2x in prior 7 days) catches 17/29 at 37% escalation. Report: https://claude.ai/code/artifact/d228dd86-85f6-4f50-a4e3-3a1aa0dc2706","timestamp":1787359203100686001}],"created_at":1787359160218800001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"33957a59-61db-4949-a646-fd877a802fc5","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_r